9mWAxWnnq8BHVSdOVUQ3YcHCM4CKAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwj9npz499mWAxWnnq8BHVSdOVUQ3IcHCM0CKBM",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["沾麵\u0026拉麵個人較推薦沾麵，正常份量沒加麵男生大概吃個7、8分飽。\n\n每人低消一碗麵，可加價加肉、加麵、加糖心蛋。雞叉燒幾乎沒什麼調味，舒肥處理吃起來很嫩，但就是這樣而已，沒什麼記憶點。溏心蛋有原味\u0026酒味兩種，這次吃酒味還不錯吃，蛋黃約8分熟，不會流動的。\n\n魚介沾麵的湯口味不會太過於鹹口，雖然是魚介風味，但乾魚味比例卻抓的剛好不會過於濃厚，但未加清湯稀釋的湯頭一樣無法直接喝，麵體跟一般沾麵一樣粗麵口感Q彈，還有沾麵的麵跟叉燒都是冷的，只有沾湯是熱的，所以吃到一半沾麵湯就會冷掉，但可以請服務人員幫你再加熱。\n\n干貝雞湯拉麵湯頭干貝味挺重的，雞湯味有一點點被蓋過，湯喝起來是清爽的，麵條是細麵可以選擇軟硬度，整體吃起來不到驚艷。\n小菜點了漬物都有醃入味，黃瓜跟蘿蔔都保有一定的脆度，但CP值不佳。",null,[0,32]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kM1JsY3paM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kM1JsY3paM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kM1JsY3paM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kM1JsY3paM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kM1JsY3paM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/5852855742768164933/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTm9kM1JsY3paM1JSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,1326,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNod3RlczZ3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xc45a4fb872906ad6!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIChwtes6wE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNod3RlczZ3RRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNod3RlczZ3RRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNod3Rlc0d3EhNDZ3dJcEtDUG53WVFxUGJoLXdJGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ2h3dG